An empty block comment (`/**/`) is a header comment without text, so no header is printed; the glob view prints a declaration summary instead.
== args
input/empty-header.ts
input
== file input/empty-header.ts
/**/
export const x = 1;
== stdout
glob view: input/empty-header.ts input
input/empty-header.ts (2 lines): export const x
== stderr
== exit 0
